  "InstallUsageNotes": "FOUNDATION / VALIDATION BUILD.\\r\\nAdd [SDK] and EnableDataBroadcast=1 to 737NG3_Options.ini, then fully restart MSFS.\\r\\nExperimental aircraft writes are OFF by default and this manifest advertises no active door/equipment sync.\\r\\nUse this build first to validate ClientData and raw state logging.\\r\\nThe existing generic PMDG 737 profile is intentionally not modified.",
